      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "बीती बात के लिए क्रिया का दूसरा रूप। ज़्यादातर में -ed लगता है: cook → cooked, play → played। कुछ बिल्कुल बदल जाते हैं: write → wrote, give → gave।",
        "hinglish": "Beeti baat ke liye kriya ka doosra roop. Zyaadatar mein -ed lagta hai: cook → cooked, play → played. Kuch bilkul badal jaate hain: write → wrote, give → gave.",
        "en": "For the past, use the past form. Most verbs add -ed: cook → cooked, play → played. Some change completely: write → wrote, give → gave."
      }
    },
