        "book.grammar",
        "grammar.tenses"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "y पर ख़त्म होने वाले शब्द: y हटाकर -ied: try → tried, fry → fried, copy → copied। कुछ शब्द नहीं बदलते: put → put, hit → hit, read → read (पर ‘रेड’ बोलते हैं), cut → cut।",
        "hinglish": "y par khatm hone waale shabd: y hataakar -ied: try → tried, fry → fried, copy → copied. Kuch shabd nahi badalte: put → put, hit → hit, read → read (par ‘red’ bolte hain), cut → cut.",
        "en": "Words ending in y: drop y and add -ied: try → tried, fry → fried, copy → copied. Some don't change: put → put, hit → hit, read → read (said ‘red’), cut → cut."
      }
    },
